# `project-rename` renames columns in place; items apply in order, so names can be swapped through a
# third name.
mode: run
---- query
from '../../../data/orders.csv'
| sort by orderId asc
| take 2
| project-rename id = orderId, customer = customerId
| project-rename tmp = id, id = customer, customer = tmp
---- expected
customer | id     | amount | timestamp
string   | string | real   | datetime
---------+--------+--------+---------------------
o-0001   | c-042  |  183.5 | 2023-12-02T08:26:08Z
o-0002   | c-042  |   88.5 | 2023-12-07T21:01:50Z
